# EvtGen user decay file for k4DTF test samples
#
#   B- -> D0 pi-,  D0 -> K- pi+ pi0,  pi0 -> gamma gamma   (+ c.c.)
#
# Decay descriptor (k4DTF / LHCb notation):
#   B- -> (D0 -> K- pi+ (pi0 -> gamma gamma)) pi-
#
# The pi0 is forced to two photons (no Dalitz decays). The D0 decays in
# phase space (simple and enough for fitter tests).
#
# Use with DelphesPythia8EvtGen_EDM4HEP_k4Interface ... 521 Bu_SIGNAL 1

Alias      Bu_SIGNAL       B+
Alias      Bubar_SIGNAL    B-
ChargeConj Bu_SIGNAL       Bubar_SIGNAL
#
Alias      MyD0            D0
Alias      MyAnti-D0       anti-D0
ChargeConj MyD0            MyAnti-D0
#
Alias      MyPi0           pi0
ChargeConj MyPi0           MyPi0
#
Decay Bubar_SIGNAL
  1.000    MyD0       pi-          PHSP;
Enddecay
CDecay Bu_SIGNAL
#
Decay MyD0
  1.000    K-         pi+          MyPi0        PHSP;
Enddecay
CDecay MyAnti-D0
#
Decay MyPi0
  1.000    gamma      gamma        PHSP;
Enddecay
#
End
